Here is a way to help you AVOID them:


Usually you can see them before they take the first thing.
After that they typically stay invisible between "attacks," so it
helps if you have a ring of "see invisible"  so you have a better chance
of outrunning them or getting a swing in right before they try 
something again.

Here is a way to neutralize them:

If you are lucky enough to have a wand of cancellation, you can zap
them and then they appear too plain to seduce you.


